{"message":"Please set your network mode preference to 4G/5G preferred. On your device, run:

set_network_mode_preference(mode="4g_5g_preferred")

Let me know once you’ve completed this step."}

{"message":"Great! Next, please toggle your mobile data connection. On your device, run:

toggle_data()

Let me know once you’ve completed this step."}

{"message":"Thanks! Now please disable Data Saver mode on your device by running:

toggle_data_saver_mode()

Let me know once you’ve completed this step."}

{"message":"Please toggle Data Roaming on your device by running:

toggle_roaming()

Let me know once you’ve completed this step and we’ll verify your connection."}

{"message":"Thanks! Next, please run a speed test to check your connection by executing:

run_speed_test()

Let me know the results so we can diagnose further."}
